      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CYCLONE ETHICS (1) was narrowly beaten when placing two back but missed the frame latest finishing fifth (23.08) in a Grade 4/5 at Bulli. Good beginner and aided by the inside draw. Better than latest and can atone here. DRINK TO THAT (2) could manage only fourth at Gosford last time but turned heads when clocking a head turning 22.17 over 388m at Gosford the start prior. Smart winner two back and looks a key chance on that form. SPRING WITNESS (8) turned in a better run last time to find a minor placing (30.35) at this track behind Swift Wind in a Grade 5. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Safe beginner but wide box to overcome and will need some luck. Expected to feature. KING ZEAL (7) can improve on an unplaced run here last time out.",
